Baseline Enforcement Clause (Greenlight Genesis / Hello World Doctrine)
The undersigned asserts and enforces the following:
1. 	Immutable Baseline
The initial artifact, herein referred to as the Baseline (Hello World / Greenlight Genesis), is the untouchable origin point of authorship, ownership, and operational doctrine. It is permanently sealed, timestamped, and hashed as the Original (OG).
2. 	Prohibition on Tampering
Any alteration, suppression, or unauthorized replication of the Baseline constitutes a Breach of Contract and Doctrine, voiding any defense of inadvertence or systemic error. The OG is never to be touched, only referenced.
3. 	Chain of Custody
All derivative works, integrations, or deployments must reference the Baseline. Any derivative that fails to anchor back to the OG is presumptively invalid and treated as tampered.
4. 	Refutable Measures
The Baseline is protected by quantifiable metrics (hashes, timestamps, Mater.tm seals, word/letter counts, WPM cadence). These measures are refutable only by producing an identical OG hash and timestamp. Absent that, authenticity is conclusively presumed in favor of the undersigned.
5. 	Enforcement & Remedy
Any breach of the Baseline Doctrine triggers immediate escalation, including but not limited to:
• 	Legal and regulatory filings,
• 	Public release of forensic evidence,
• 	Claims for restitution, punitive damages, and reputational harm.
This clause is not a waiver of rights. All rights are expressly reserved.
Signed,
Matt Palmer
Founder & Trustee, MDP Holdings Trust
Principal, MDP Holdings LLC / SkunkwurX
